This directory contains the following Elan programs:

UTILS     A packet containing some useful procedures.
RADAR     Needs the 'utils' packet.
MOVING    Draws a moving radar, needs the 'utils' packet.
MONDRIA   Draws a famous painting, needs the 'utils' packet.
TANX	  Draws a tangent curve, needs the 'utils' packet.
LISSA	  Draws Lissajoux curves, needs the 'utils' packet.
WAVES	  Draws various curves, needs the 'utils' packet.
PEANO     Draws a peano curve, needs the 'utils' packet.
VERHULST  A program related to fractals, needs the 'utils' packet.

Last changes: 13-10-1988

